{"id":"4ef2ebb7b79718cb","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-one-way-permutation.md","title":"保长单向置换","display":"df-one-way-permutation — 保长单向置换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-one-way-permutation","aliases":["28-df-one-way-permutation"],"display":"df-one-way-permutation — 保长单向置换","depends_on":["[[28-df-one-way-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.3 and Lemma 9.10","source_printed_pages":"180–181","source_pdf_pages":"206–207","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-one-way-permutation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-one-way-permutation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-way-permutation — 保长单向置换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.3 and Lemma 9.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"180–181"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"206–207"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{OWF}\">\\(\\mathbf{OWF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n\">\\(f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n\\)</span> 为定义域限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{OWP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n:\\Sigma^n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma^n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{OWP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n:\\Sigma^n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma^n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>要求每个长度上的双射，所以f保长，并在该长度内有唯一原像。单向性仍按均匀随机输入的平均成功率量化所有PPT求逆器；这是复杂度假设，不是把任意可计算置换宣称难以求逆。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§9.3 and Lemma 9.10；印刷 pp.180–181 / PDF pp.206–207。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-one-way-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$。$f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n$ 为定义域限制。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{OWF}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{OWP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n:\\Sigma^n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Sigma^n\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1381,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]、[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]、[[28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound]]、[[28-df-one-way-permutation]]、[[28-thm-ggm-prf]]、[[28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse]]。"}],"outgoing":["76af324ae3acb27e"]}